  "question": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{S}(\\mathrm{~g})+\\frac{3}{2} \\mathrm{O}_2(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightarrow \\mathrm{SO}_3(\\mathrm{~g})+2 x \\mathrm{kcal} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{SO}_2(\\mathrm{~g})+\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{O}_2(\\mathrm{~g}) \\rightarrow \\mathrm{SO}_3(\\mathrm{~g})+y \\mathrm{kcal}\n\\end{aligned}$\n\nThe heat of formation of $\\mathrm{SO}_2(\\mathrm{~g})$ is given by :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$x+y \\mathrm{kcal}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$y-2 x \\mathrm{kcal}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
